{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>益節7合1補骨健肌關節全效配方240粒裝（Move Free 7-in-1 Total Mobility Care）邊度買平？新假期整理屈臣氏、萬寧及HKTVmall共3間零售商的網店報價。以同款單盒標價計，最低與次低相差HK$136，約23%。</p>\n<h2>益節7合1補骨健肌關節全效配方240粒裝各網店報價</h2>\n<table>\n<thead></thead>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><strong>零售商</strong></th>\n<th><strong>單盒標價</strong></th>\n<th><strong>單盒總額</strong></th>\n<th><strong>計價條件</strong></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>最低已核實｜HKTVmall</strong></td>\n<td><strong>HK$458</strong></td>\n<td><strong>HK$458</strong></td>\n<td><strong>單盒標價</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>屈臣氏</td>\n<td>HK$594</td>\n<td>HK$594</td>\n<td>單盒標價</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>萬寧</td>\n<td>HK$594</td>\n<td>HK$594</td>\n<td>單盒標價</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2>益節7合1補骨健肌關節全效配方240粒裝單盒價錢點計？</h2>\n<p>買一盒益節7合1補骨健肌關節全效配方240粒裝，HKTVmall的同款網上標價為HK$458，較表列次低標價HK$594少HK$136。益節7合1補骨健肌關節全效配方240粒裝這個價差以單盒商品標價比較。若打算買多件，宜另計商戶的購買條件及結帳價。</p>\n<p>買兩盒時，屈臣氏另列兩件或以上7折，同款兩盒合共HK$831.6。單盒與兩盒的最低方案可以不同。</p>\n<p>以上為2026年11月23日商戶網上報價，未計運費，價格、優惠及供應以商戶為準。網店來源：<a href=\"https://www.watsons.com.hk/zh-hk/%E7%9B%8A%E7%AF%80-%E7%9B%8A%E7%AF%80-7%E5%90%881%E8%A3%9C%E9%AA%A8.%E5%81%A5%E8%82%8C.%E9%97%9C%E7%AF%80%E5%85%A8%E6%95%88%E9%85%8D%E6%96%B9240%E7%B2%92/p/BP_264360\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">屈臣氏</a><a href=\"https://www.mannings.com.hk/zh-hant/move-free-7-in-1-total-mobility-care-joints-bones-muscle-240pcs/p/694133\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">萬寧</a><a href=\"https://www.hktvmall.com/hktv/zh/main/FLY/s/B1285002/%E8%AD%B7%E7%90%86%E4%BF%9D%E5%81%A5/%E8%AD%B7%E7%90%86%E4%BF%9D%E5%81%A5/%E4%BF%9D%E5%81%A5%E7%94%A2%E5%93%81/%E9%AA%A8%E9%AA%BC-%E9%97%9C%E7%AF%80/%E7%9B%8A%E7%AF%80-7%E5%90%881-%E8%A3%9C%E9%AA%A8%E5%81%A5%E8%82%8C%E9%97%9C%E7%AF%80%E5%85%A8%E6%95%88%E9%85%8D%E6%96%B9-240%E7%B2%92%E8%A3%9D/p/B1285002_S_JK9706\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">HKTVmall</a></p>\n<p>香港零售標籤列出鈣及維他命D。鈣是骨骼及牙齒的主要成分之一，維他命D有助身體吸收鈣。如對成分或服用有疑問，建議先諮詢醫生或其他合資格的醫護專業人士。<a href=\"https://ods.od.nih.gov/factsheets/Calcium-Consumer/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">NIH：鈣的消費者資料</a></p>\n<p>本次以（HK$594－HK$458）÷HK$594×100%計，約23%。計算方法：（較高標價－較低標價）÷較高標價×100%。上述比例未計運費及額外活動，亦不代表全港最低價、歷史低價或不同包裝版本的配方已完全核實一致。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179536507825673820_6930665796b0318d6dc0a8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"益節7合1補骨健肌關節全效配方240粒裝格價\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179536507825673820_6930665796b0318d6dc0a8.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a></p>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>點樣先可以用圖中價格買到益節7合1補骨健肌關節全效配方240粒裝？<i></i></p>\n<p>以2026年11月23日網上報價，HKTVmall的單盒商品總額為HK$458。條件為單盒標價，未計運費。</p>\n<p>今次格價比較哪一款包裝？<i></i></p>\n<p>本次比較7合1全效配方240粒單盒。核對7合1字樣及240粒規格，跟同品牌5合1、其他粒數或套裝分開計。</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T16:44:14.932105+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":863,"images":1,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T16:31:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T22:57:45.047699+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T16:37:46.238448+00:00","content_hash":"5a408f818ff362d35b8c49496e1862d9ecb11560445983ec833da2aab756208f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}